        "value": "<p><strong>Necrosphinx.</strong> A solo presence from the Tomb Kings of Khemri, built for brutal, legible table play. Its numbers are recalibrated from a PF2e-style creature benchmark and mapped back onto D&D challenge expectations.</p><p><strong>Rules Profile.</strong> AC 22; HP 770; proficiency +7; save DC 23. Linked armory entries: 16. Linked spell entries: 0.</p><blockquote><p>\"A warrior is measured when the line begins to break.\"<br><em>- Old World battlefield saying</em></p></blockquote>",
